   "id": "cb5ae52d-9f13-4c10-bbe0-ecdd9eeeae47",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/markdown": [
       "**`%%yukti`** sets the privileges every later `%%ask` cell runs with.\n",
       "Write one `key: value` per line. A `permissions` line applies a whole\n",
       "profile, and a later line overrides one of its values.\n",
       "\n",
       "| profile | sandbox | cwd | network | tools |\n",
       "| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n",
       "| `sandboxed` | read-only | disposable | off | off |\n",
       "| `elevated` | workspace-write | kernel directory | off | on |\n",
       "| `full` | danger-full-access | kernel directory | on | on |\n",
       "\n",
       "- `permissions`: sandboxed | elevated | full\n",
       "- `sandbox`: read-only | workspace-write | danger-full-access\n",
       "- `approvals`: never | auto_review\n",
       "- `cwd`: a path, or empty for a disposable directory\n",
       "- `network`: on | off\n",
       "- `tools`: on | off\n",
       "- `writable_roots`: paths separated by commas\n",
       "\n",
       "In force now: approvals = never, cwd = disposable, network = off, permissions = sandboxed, sandbox = read-only, tools = off, writable_roots = none.\n",
       "\n",
       "```python\n",
       "%%yukti\n",
       "permissions: elevated\n",
       "```"
      ],
      "text/plain": [
       "<IPython.core.display.Markdown object>"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 3,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "%%yukti "
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "id": "449607fb-ba10-4ab0-a77c-a2dabecc4ba1",
   "metadata": {},
